<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>whale-on-desk — the DSH companion that knows what your agent is doing</title>
<meta name="description" content="A pixel-art whale companion for DeepSeek Harness. It reports finished turns, taps the glass when approvals wait, and brings an aquarium skin plus the first command palette to the DSH web client.">
<style>
  :root { --bg:#0D1420; --panel:#131E30; --ink:#F2F5F9; --dim:#8FA3C4; --foam:#BFE3FF; --pink:#E58FA2; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; margin:0 }
  body { background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font:16px/1.7 system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif; }
  .wrap { max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px }
  a { color:var(--foam) }
  header { padding:72px 0 40px; text-align:center; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#101E33 0%,var(--bg) 100%) }
  h1 { font-size:44px; letter-spacing:-1px }
  h1 span { color:var(--foam) }
  .tag { color:var(--dim); font-size:19px; margin:14px auto 26px; max-width:640px }
  .tag b { color:var(--ink) }
  .badges { margin-bottom:34px }
  .badges img { height:20px; margin:0 3px }
  .hero { width:100%; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid #1E3050; box-shadow:0 24px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.5) }
  .install { display:inline-block; background:#0A0F1A; border:1px solid #24406B; border-radius:10px; padding:12px 22px; font-family:Consolas,monospace; font-size:15px; margin-top:26px }
  .install b { color:var(--foam); font-weight:400 }
  section { padding:48px 0 }
  h2 { font-size:26px; margin-bottom:18px }
  h2 em { color:var(--pink); font-style:normal }
  .grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:16px }
  .card { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid #1C2C47; border-radius:14px; padding:18px 20px }
  .card h3 { font-size:17px; margin-bottom:6px }
  .card p { color:var(--dim); font-size:14px }
  .states { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:center; padding:10px 0 4px }
  .states figure { text-align:center }
  .states img { width:92px; image-rendering:pixelated }
  .states figcaption { font-size:11px; color:var(--dim); margin-top:2px }
  .aqua { width:100%; border-radius:14px; border:1px solid #1E3050 }
  footer { padding:36px 0 60px; color:var(--dim); font-size:14px; text-align:center }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="wrap">
  <h1>whale-on-desk <span>🐳</span></h1>
  <p class="tag">A pixel-art whale companion for <b>DeepSeek Harness</b> — one that actually knows what your agents are doing. <b>Start a long task, walk away, come back when the whale tells you it's done.</b></p>
  <div class="badges">
    <img src="https://img.shields.io/npm/v/whale-on-desk" alt="npm">
    <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/license-MIT-blue" alt="MIT">
    <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/DSH-plugin-4D6BFE" alt="DSH plugin">
    <img src="https://img.shields.io/badge/states-29-23324D" alt="14 states">
  </div>
  <img class="hero" src="demo.gif" alt="whale-on-desk demo">
  <div class="install"><b>dsh plugin --profile web add whale-on-desk</b></div>
</header>

<section class="wrap">
  <h2>Not just a sticker <em>— it works for you</em></h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card"><h3>🗣 Completion reports</h3><p>Finished turns speak up: "搞定! 3 分 12 秒,跑了 8 个工具,改了 5 个文件" — real numbers from session events.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>🔔 Approval alerts</h3><p>The whale taps the glass and your browser tab title flashes — visible from any other tab or window.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>⌘ Command palette</h3><p>DSH ships a command registry but the web UI never got a launcher. The whale brought one — filter, run, zero model turns.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>🐠 Aquarium skin</h3><p>A painted water layer over your working UI: keep coding inside the tank while token fish count tool calls and a coral grows with progress.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>🔬 Pixel-audited art</h3><p>14 states, every sprite sheet frame-checked — exact 8-color palette, zero debris, seamless loops — before it ships.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><h3>🐙 Pet forge</h3><p>Ask your agent for a pet: "make me a pink octopus" — it designs, audits, cuts, installs, and hot-swaps it live.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <h2 style="text-align:center">Twenty-nine states of hand-crafted pixel art</h2>
  <div class="states">
    <figure><img src="greet.gif" alt=""><figcaption>waves hello</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="think.gif" alt=""><figcaption>thinks along</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="glass-tap.gif" alt=""><figcaption>taps the glass</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="celebrate.gif" alt=""><figcaption>backflip</figcaption></figure>
    <figure><img src="sleep.gif" alt=""><figcaption>nightcap</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="birthday.gif" alt=""><figcaption>birthday!</figcaption></figure><figure><img src="shy.gif" alt=""><figcaption>shy</figcaption></figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap">
  <h2>The aquarium, over your real UI</h2>
  <img class="aqua" src="aquarium.gif" alt="aquarium mode">
</section>

<footer class="wrap">
  MIT · <a href="https://github.com/cookiesheep/whale-on-desk">GitHub</a> · <a href="https://www.npmjs.com/package/whale-on-desk">npm</a><br>
  Listed on <a href="https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin">awesome-dsh-plugin</a> · Works in the DSH web UI and the community DSH Desktop app.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
